The [[Blood Spiral]] travelled into the centre of the volcano and began searching for the Ring using ceramic rods. The Huntik team, however, managed to destroy the Lodestone, disabling the anti-magic field surrounding the area and enabling them to use their powers. {{Source|The Dead Magic Island}}

The Huntik team entered the volcano through a lava tube, and, after launching a surprise attack on [[Wind]] and [[Shauna]], the team deduced that the Amulet would be in the leftmost pit, as the leftmost gem on the Amulet of Will was red. After a huge battle, [[Sophie Casterwill]] dived into the pit, overcoming her fear of the fire. The volcano subsequently erupted, forcing the others to flee. Sophie then emerged from the volcano with [[Phoenix]], reborn from the ashes. {{Source|The Phoenix's Ashes}}
